ESP32 firmware is built with Espressif Arduino-ESP32 and its bundled components. Desktop
packages may dynamically use Qt 6 Core, Gui, and Widgets. Managed/offline toolchain packages
must reproduce the license and notice files shipped by their upstream archives.

No telemetry or project-data transmission is enabled by default.
